{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The World\u2019s Most Sinister Spot-the-Difference Game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a convict serving your sentence. On the day your time is up, a strange ritual begins\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A psychological thriller where you hunt down and shoot the hidden \u201cdifferences\u201d lurking across seven stages, confronting your own sins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25a0 Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Fusion of Spot-the-Difference and Shooting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not just clicking\u2014pulling the trigger itself becomes an act that shakes your psyche.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ever-Changing Differences with Each Playthrough</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The layout shifts every time, enhancing replayability and letting you uncover new horrors again and again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Collision of Guilt and Release</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The desperation of failing to find the answers, the catharsis of each shot, and, in the end, the truth that awaits you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot down every difference.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But can you really say that makes it right?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723720?t=1754048094","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723720/e7fa14f6dcb4a05aa6a9b11e5c76760bdf0fb532/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754048094","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723720/ec243d4ea341a713b02b156334365039b92789e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754048094","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723720/ec243d4ea341a713b02b156334365039b92789